    "text": "Figure 5 — Before/after comparison of a fitness app wireframe: the left \"Raw Generation\" screen has text-only buttons (return, settings, more options), overlapping \"Healthy\"/\"Get Started\" text, a duplicated \"see more\" button and an off-screen text block, marked with blue letters A-F; the centre lists \"Semantic Icons\", \"Text Typography\" and \"UI Guidelines\" with small icons; the right \"Post Processing\" screen shows a back arrow, gear and three-dot icons, resized text and corrected layout.",
